{"noun":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/4a/b7/61004_crt_E43N0.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/4a/b7/61004_crt_E43N0.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/4a/b7/61004_crt_E43N0.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/4a/b7/61004_crt_E43N0.jpg"},"name":"尾崎レオナ","summary":"年轻的女性警署长官，为巡查部长，T31炮手，第一分队队长。\r\n\r\n极度热心于自己的工作，并且十分爱护自己的坦克 “ボナパルト”（Bonaparte）。原来隶属于摩托警部。她的名字和坦克的昵称可能是参考的19世纪早期的法国统治者 “拿破轮”（Napoleon Bonaparte）.","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/31/1a/3885_seiyu_anidb.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/31/1a/3885_seiyu_anidb.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/31/1a/3885_seiyu_anidb.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/31/1a/3885_seiyu_anidb.jpg"},"name":"佐久間レイ","short_summary":"日本の声優、女優、歌手、ナレーターである。本名は佐久間 玲子（さくま れいこ）。アイドル時代の後半には、佐久間 麗の表記で活動しており、この頃の愛称はガー子だった。2014年現在は81プロデュースに所属している。代表作に『愛の若草物語』（エイミー・マーチ）、『それいけ!アンパンマン』（バタコさん）、『楽しいムーミン一家』(ミイ)、『魔女の宅急便』（ジジ）、『とっとこハム太郎』（マフラーちゃん、春名ヒロミ）、『おねがいマイメロディ』シリーズ（マイメロディ）などがある。","career":["artist","seiyu"],"id":3885,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":61004},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/ea/17/218756_crt_6hr8F.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/ea/17/218756_crt_6hr8F.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/ea/17/218756_crt_6hr8F.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/ea/17/218756_crt_6hr8F.jpg"},"name":"アンナプーナ","summary":"","relation":"配角","actors":[],"type":1,"id":218756},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/07/a6/218757_crt_cbO5F.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/07/a6/218757_crt_cbO5F.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/07/a6/218757_crt_cbO5F.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/07/a6/218757_crt_cbO5F.jpg"},"name":"ユニプーマ","summary":"","relation":"配角","actors":[],"type":1,"id":218757}],"detail":[{"birth_mon":null,"gender":"female","birth_day":null,"birth_year":null,"blood_type":null,"images":{"small":